WEBVTT

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:05.800
<i>Myr's grief and rage after losing 
his beloved wife sent him on a rampage.</i>

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.080
<i>Seth tried to stop him,</i>

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.660
<i>but as if responding in kind, 
he also lost control of himself.</i>

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.210
<i>As all this went on, Fantasia continued
 to disappear from the land.</i>

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:21.230
<i>People fight one another. 
How foolish can they be?</i>

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:22.480
Seth!

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.750
Don't lose yourself!

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:28.880
No!

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.590
Wait!

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.380
Seth!

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:36.680
Myrddin...

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:40.770
That name... That divine name...

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:42.750
belongs to the great Merlin!

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:52.910
Ah, I can sense it!

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:58.130
The cry of his soul, 
filled with grief, pain, and rage!

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:01.420
It's marvelous! Let me feel it, too!

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:06.480
Oh Father of the Inquisition, 
founder of miracles...

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:10.110
By your divine light, 
guide those who are lost!

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:17.330
Oh, what intense pain!

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:20.470
That's it. Take all of that agony...

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:24.060
and give it to me.

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:31.750
The castle wall is starting to collapse!

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:34.490
Good! Continue firing 
and pick up the pace!

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:36.790
Keep the bombardment going!

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:38.490
What?!

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:47.000
Greetings, everyone.

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:22.970
<b>A Bouquet of Flowers for This Land 
-Fantasia-</b>

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:20.730
<i>"A Bouquet of Flowers for This Land."</i>

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:34.690
I...

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:38.440
I've betrayed the god

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:41.200
that I believe in the most.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.010
Myrddin...

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:44.450
Your Majesty...

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:51.150
Ocoho?

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.430
Ocoho! Don't be reckless!

00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:03.260
You'll be crushed!

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:04.840
Even so!

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:18.770
I may have lost a leg, 
but on the great Merlin's name,

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:22.610
this land and my will are indomitable!

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.270
Ocoho!

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:43.260
We have to protect the land of Cyfandir!

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.970
No, not only the land!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:48.760
We have to defend all those 
who live upon it!

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:55.390
People who want to enslave the citizens 
of this country are attacking us!

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:57.770
The people's pain is the queen's pain!

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:01.660
If the people are suffering, 
the queen has to take a stand!

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:07.030
But I could not protect them.

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:11.290
I... am not worthy to be queen.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:18.610
Stand up.

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:23.460
You are... 
You are the queen of this nation!

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.720
You don't have time 
to sit around complaining!

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.430
That goes for me, too.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:32.470
Please, I beg you! Stand up!

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:34.480
Ocoho...

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:39.370
You...

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:43.110
have resisted your own destiny.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:50.020
So I must also stand 
and face my own destiny.

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:56.120
I am the only one capable 
of destroying this machine now.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.370
Your Majesty!

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:01.250
But how will you destroy 
such a huge machine?

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:05.990
Brangoire, do you underestimate me?

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:10.010
If both magic and weapons have failed,

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:11.690
we have no choice

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:15.270
but to rely on my bewitching body!

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.130
Your Majesty!

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.380
Your Majesty, please stop!

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:26.650
No, I know our queen can do this!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:30.530
You're not someone who would lose 
to a hunk of scrap metal like that!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.940
You can do it, Your Majesty!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.660
She's right!

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:44.040
Our queen cannot lose
 to a mere scrap of metal!

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:49.550
<i>I am Boudica, queen of Cyfandir!</i>

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.850
<i>This body is not my own!</i>

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:54.800
<i>Every drop of blood in my veins, 
every hair on my head,</i>

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:56.890
<i>belongs to the people of Cyfandir!</i>

00:06:56.890 --> 00:07:00.390
<i>Therefore, even if I meet my end here,</i>

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:03.150
<i>I will protect this land 
until my final moments!</i>

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.900
Your Majesty! Go!

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:09.030
On the great Merlin's name, 
defeat that thing!

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.180
Your Majesty!

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:27.300
Are you all right?

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:32.300
I'm just fine. No need to worry.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.930
That's our queen!

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.580
<i>On Merlin's name!</i>

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.430
<i>We're back!</i>

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:43.180
<i>We've come back to life!</i>

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:45.060
Uh, no, 
you guys have been dead for ages—

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.370
<i>Now, let us go!</i>

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:47.190
Where?!

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:50.330
<i>We're going to stop Myrddin.</i>

00:07:50.890 --> 00:07:52.810
We're going to save Seth!

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:56.130
Seth fought his hardest 
to save everyone!

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:59.190
We have to protect him now!

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:01.570
If they mass-produced a machine like this,

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:05.210
you guys would all be enslaved 
with no say in the matter.

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.550
You're...

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:08.820
Sorry to rain on your parade,

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:10.960
but the situation has grown urgent.

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:14.160
If you wish to go 
to where the horned boy is,

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.690
I can take you there.

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.980
You know where he is?

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:23.410
He's in the custody of the Thaumaturges, 
still in his berserk form.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:24.100
What?

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:27.310
Please, take me to where Seth is!

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:28.860
Melie, you...

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:39.740
Let's go.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.500
H-Hey!

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:50.770
Don't let go.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:59.740
By the way, even if you
 get him back from Major Ullmina,

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:01.850
you can't stop his rampage.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:05.870
Yes, it was Grimm 
who stopped him before.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.540
The bandaged sorcerer, eh?

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.230
That's perfect, then.

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:22.760
Hmm... The Fantasia is returning.

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:26.000
Did someone destroy that machine?

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.380
The Thaumaturge captain!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.380
He's helping us now!

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:35.890
Helping?

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:39.450
I see. You fought against Grimm before.

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:41.510
What is your motive now?

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:44.220
To rescue the horned boy.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:45.390
Can you do it?

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:51.480
Ah... It's so enormous.

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:54.150
This dark, dark power of suffering

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:55.870
is flowing into me.

00:09:57.110 --> 00:10:00.780
You are the mysterious horned sorcerer, 
aren't you?

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:05.160
Wonderful... How wonderful!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:09.970
Now, return to Bome with me.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:15.960
Seth!

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:18.980
Return that jet-black soul at once!

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:20.840
It belongs to me!

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:23.040
Don't treat Seth like some object!

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:25.220
Seth doesn't belong to anyone!

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:29.630
No! No! No! No! No!

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:30.650
Don't go!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:31.580
Let's go!

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:32.400
Yes.

00:10:35.850 --> 00:10:38.870
This is all I can do right now.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:43.980
If you guys are right, then survive.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:48.410
Major Ullmina...

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:54.770
Ah... My... My pain...

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:57.030
My pain... My pain...

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.560
I want it...

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:01.850
I want it... I want it.

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:05.830
I want it, I want it, I want it, 
I want it, I want it, I want it.

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:05.830
Mother!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:10.310
Please keep your wits about you.

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.060
Prince... Verone...

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:16.600
Using your miracle 
on someone who's still alive

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:17.900
is too dangerous.

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:23.070
Your spirit could be mixed together 
with that tainted thing.

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:24.430
If that happens...

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.580
It's all right now.

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:33.830
How could I have done 
such a dreadful thing?

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:36.220
<i>Jet-black soul...</i>

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:41.830
<i>One day, I will immerse myself 
in your wonderful pain.</i>

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:43.330
<i>Surely...</i>

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:49.590
Major Ullmina, the Harmonizium has been lost 
because of Queen Boudica.

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:50.420
Oh...

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.180
Colonel Santori is gone, as well.

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:54.590
It is unfortunate,

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:56.980
but it appears this is the end.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:00.610
You filthy infected ones,

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:05.770
in the near future, 
we shall guide you into the light.

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:10.300
Look forward to the day 
when you shall receive this blessing.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.010
Look! They're fleeing!

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.530
Victory is ours!

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.440
We did it!

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.490
Cyfandir is saved!

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:30.020
What is that?

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:38.050
It's quiet now.

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.530
What is that monster?!

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:03.740
It's attacking the Inquisition!

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:06.020
It must be a messenger 
from the great Merlin!

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:09.200
It has to be! Hooray for 
the great Merlin's messenger!

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:10.720
Hooray!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:15.500
Glory to this savior and
 friend to the people of Cyfandir!

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:21.980
Hooray! Hooray! Hooray!

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:24.990
I will kill them all!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.000
Put up a barrier!

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.500
Sciath!

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:42.500
Defend while retreating 
to the castle gate!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:46.630
That is the wrath of nature.

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:50.430
Insignificant humans are powerless against it.

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.260
Oh, no...

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:55.590
Seth, there's trouble! Please wake up!

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:58.270
You're the only one who can stop Myr!

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.020
Seth...

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:02.350
You would be wise to stop.

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:05.990
Nothing good will come of him 
awakening right now.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:10.030
But Seth would be angry 
if we just did nothing!

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.430
Come back to your senses!

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:15.540
Myr is trying to destroy everything!

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:24.350
Not good. His bonds will soon 
break if this goes on.

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.290
<i>What can I...</i>

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:30.000
<i>Maybe if I try within the Sidh...</i>

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.540
<i>Seth, please listen!</i>

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.730
What... is this?

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:48.740
Seth? Are you in there?

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.630
Ocoho?! Why are you here?

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:58.500
I heard you screaming!

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.850
Seth's inside this, right?

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:02.010
Yes!

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:03.570
Damn him!

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:06.390
Don't get trapped within darkness 
at a time like this!

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:08.510
Where are the results of your training?!

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:11.940
Seth, listen!

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:14.970
Myr is about to destroy everything!

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:21.520
Is that...

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:24.290
the Inquisition's ship?

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:26.540
<i>They're helping us?</i>

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:29.900
Did we get him?

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.690
No! It had no effect at all!

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:35.760
What?!

00:15:35.760 --> 00:15:38.540
It doesn't matter! Don't stop firing!

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.340
It will give some soldiers a chance to escape.

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:42.290
Yes, sir!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:44.920
Seth! Turn this way!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.420
Look at me!

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.050
Th-That's not good!

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.670
It's facing this way!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.670
Evade! Full to starboard!

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.740
The bindings are coming loose!

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:12.660
Hurry!

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:15.950
If you're going to get Seth back, 
there isn't much time!

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:23.250
Seth, I know you're hurting 
because Jill is gone!

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:27.530
But if this keeps up, 
both you and Myr will become monsters!

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:30.300
Even if it's tough, even if we're sad,

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.590
we have to face forward!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:36.190
Were you lying when you said 
you wouldn't turn your back on me?

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:38.100
Please, Seth...

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:42.730
Don't leave me alone again!

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.480
Seth, hurry! It's Myr!

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:55.180
An even bigger attack is coming!

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:55.860
What?!

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:05.120
Titan Punch!

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:14.880
That's... the horned sorcerer!

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:20.640
You think you've repaid your debt?

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:24.450
Captain, shouldn't we flee 
while we have the chance?

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:26.390
What will we find after running away?

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:30.420
Our squad will do 
what we think is right.

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:32.840
We're going to back up the sorcerers!

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:33.780
Yes, sir!

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:43.390
Myr, calm down.

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:44.770
What?

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:50.090
I know what happened to the forest 
saddens you to death.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.550
But this isn't what Jill would want!

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:54.300
Jill!

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:58.550
Jill... didn't want this to happen!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:17:59.710
Right!

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:01.050
But...

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:05.360
Your filthy human brethren 
destroyed the forest.

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:10.060
If I had stopped them 
from clustering together in its vicinity...

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:13.320
Perhaps Jill wouldn't have died!

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:16.320
Myr! You think this would make Jill happy?!

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:19.450
Jill is gone!

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:22.950
Seth!

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:30.540
Gravem Carserem!

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:36.210
Nubes Spectris!

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:58.550
<i>Hurry...</i>

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:03.250
We have to hurry and stop Myr!

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:04.470
What are you doing?!

00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:07.530
Well... when I got close 
to the underside of this,

00:19:07.530 --> 00:19:09.660
the rocks started glowing.

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:10.620
Huh?

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:12.970
Is there something in here?

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.590
Take shelter behind the wall!

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:20.260
The great Merlin's castle wall 
will surely protect us!

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:22.010
"Merlin," you say?

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:25.260
Merlin is me!

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:29.020
Who would protect the likes of you?!

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:32.900
All the Fantasia is gathering again.

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:37.300
<i>Jill...</i>

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:42.280
<i>If I had made up my mind long ago...</i>

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:47.070
<i>If I had chased them all out of the forest...</i>

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:57.740
<i>If I hadn't listened to you...</i>

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:05.730
<i>If I had taken out my rage on them sooner...</i>

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:11.900
<i>Then you and our children...</i>

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:17.900
<i>wouldn't have been taken from me!</i>

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:58.690
Roots? Who could have done this?

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:01.690
J-Jill?

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:04.390
Is it you, Jill?

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:06.060
No, Myr.

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:09.950
I know it's hard to accept,

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:12.450
but Jill is dead.

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:17.550
Myr, I know you understand 
better than anyone.

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:21.750
Humans don't have the power to kill Jill.

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:27.170
It wasn't because of the Inquisition's 
machine that Jill died.

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:32.720
Jill could have survived 
even without Fantasia.

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:35.070
But she didn't.

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:37.850
She did it to protect them.

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:43.610
They can't protect themselves yet, right?

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
"A bouquet of flowers for this land"

00:24:00.020 --> 00:24:20.700
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:02.860
<i>Slavery, discrimination, war...</i>

00:24:02.860 --> 00:24:04.700
<i>Humans are weak and foolish.</i>

00:24:04.700 --> 00:24:08.300
<i>This is why they must join hands 
and work together in order to grow.</i>

00:24:08.750 --> 00:24:10.540
<i>The long battle has ended,</i>

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:15.930
<i>and Queen Boudica appoints a new queen 
in hopes of creating a better world.</i>

00:24:15.930 --> 00:24:20.020
<i>The journey to find Radiant, with all 
its farewells and partings, is not over.</i>

00:24:20.550 --> 00:24:24.410
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>, 
"The Future Is With You."</i>

00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>The Future Is With You 
-Eternity-</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
